import assert from 'node:assert/strict';import {mkdtemp,cp,readFile,writeFile,rm} from 'node:fs/promises';import {tmpdir} from 'node:os';import path from 'node:path';import {load} from 'cheerio/slim';import {run} from '../../engine/pipeline.mjs';import {serveStatic} from '../../engine/static.mjs';import {verifyNavigation} from '../../engine/verify-navigation.mjs';import {chromium} from 'playwright';
const artifact=path.resolve('artifacts/platform/ultimate-installed'),temp=await mkdtemp(path.join(tmpdir(),'ultimate-menus-'));let server,browser;
try{
 await cp(path.join(artifact,'project'),temp,{recursive:true});
 for(const name of ['finish-export.mjs','menu-authoring.mjs'])await cp(new URL('../../scripts/'+name,import.meta.url),path.join(temp,'scripts',name));
 await cp(new URL('../../scripts/build-export.mjs',import.meta.url),path.join(temp,'scripts/build.mjs'));
 const before=load(await readFile(path.join(temp,'output/menu-horizontal/index.html'),'utf8'))('nav.hfe-nav-menu__layout-horizontal').html();
 await run(process.execPath,['scripts/build.mjs'],{cwd:temp,timeout:120000});
 assert.equal(load(await readFile(path.join(temp,'output/menu-horizontal/index.html'),'utf8'))('nav.hfe-nav-menu__layout-horizontal').html(),before);
 const file=path.join(temp,'menus.json'),data=JSON.parse(await readFile(file));const [id,menu]=Object.entries(data.menus).find(([,m])=>m.items.some(item=>item.children?.some(child=>child.label==='Planning')));assert.ok(id);
 const parent=menu.items.find(item=>item.children),planning=parent.children.find(item=>item.label==='Planning'),support=parent.children.find(item=>item.label==='Support');parent.label='Our services';parent.children=[{id:'new-help',template:support.id,label:'New help',url:'/menu-horizontal/'},{...planning,label:'Our planning'}];menu.items=[parent,...menu.items.filter(item=>item!==parent)];await writeFile(file,JSON.stringify(data,null,2));
 await run(process.execPath,['scripts/build.mjs'],{cwd:temp,timeout:120000});
 for(const layout of ['horizontal','vertical','expandible']){const $=load(await readFile(path.join(temp,'output/menu-'+layout+'/index.html'),'utf8')),nav=$('nav.hfe-nav-menu__layout-'+layout);assert.equal(nav.find('a').first().text().trim(),'Our services');assert.equal(nav.find('.sub-menu a').first().text(),'New help');assert.equal(nav.find('.sub-menu a').last().text(),'Our planning');assert.equal(nav.find('.sub-menu a').length,2);assert.equal(nav.find('.hfe-menu-toggle').length,1);assert.ok($('header').text().includes('About'));assert.equal(nav.find('[aria-current=page]').length,layout==='horizontal'?1:0);assert.equal(nav.find('.current-menu-ancestor').length,layout==='horizontal'?1:0);}
 const contentFile=path.join(temp,'content/pages/menu-horizontal.md');await writeFile(contentFile,(await readFile(contentFile,'utf8')).replace('permalink: /menu-horizontal/','permalink: /menu-renamed/'));await run(process.execPath,['scripts/build.mjs'],{cwd:temp,timeout:120000});
 const renamed=load(await readFile(path.join(temp,'output/menu-renamed/index.html'),'utf8'));assert.equal(renamed('nav.hfe-nav-menu__layout-horizontal [aria-current=page]').attr('href'),'/menu-renamed/');assert.equal(renamed('nav.hfe-nav-menu__layout-horizontal .current-menu-parent').length,1);assert.equal(Object.keys(JSON.parse(await readFile(file)).menus).length,Object.keys(data.menus).length);
 server=await serveStatic(path.join(temp,'output'));browser=await chromium.launch({channel:'chrome'});const checks=[];
 for(const layout of ['horizontal','vertical','expandible'])for(const width of [1440,390]){const page=await browser.newPage({viewport:{width,height:900}});page.setDefaultTimeout(5000);await page.goto(server.url+(layout==='horizontal'?'/menu-renamed/':'/menu-'+layout+'/'),{waitUntil:'networkidle'});const result=(await verifyNavigation(page)).find(r=>r.kind==='addon-navigation');assert.equal(result?.status,'passed',JSON.stringify(result));checks.push({layout,width,...result});await page.close();}
 const result={defaultMarkupUnchanged:true,sharedMenuDefinitions:Object.keys(data.menus).length,authoredMenu:id,labels:true,nestedAddRemoveReorder:true,iconsPreserved:true,currentPageState:true,renamedRoute:true,checks};await writeFile(path.join(artifact,'ultimate-menu-authoring-check.json'),JSON.stringify(result,null,2));console.log(JSON.stringify(result));
}finally{await browser?.close();await server?.close();await rm(temp,{recursive:true,force:true});}
